re you take a full backup before upgrading!\n\nDiscuss this release further [on our forums](https://forum.jellyfin.org/t-new-jellyfin-server-web-release-12-3).\n\n## Changelog (7)\n\n### 🏗️  Enhancements\n* Suppresses useless warnings [PR #18337](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin/pull/18337), by @thedreaddpirate\n### 📈 General Changes\n* Do not store ratings or gains that are not finite numbers [PR #18267](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin/pull/18267), by @martimarkov\n* Fix unbalanced parenthesis in the HalfTopAndBottom image extraction filter [PR #18325](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin/pull/18325), by @cinadr\n* Update Microsoft [PR #18418](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin/pull/18418), by @Bond-009\n* Treat a year off by one as a tie in TMDb result ranking [PR #18343](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin/pull/18343), by @HaraldNordgren\n* Fix crash when a subtitle charset has no .NET encoding [PR #18309](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin/pull/18309), by @p27ZuH6CNAdzr\n* Fix crash probing streams without frame size [PR #18243](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin/pull/18243), by @myristate\n","upstream_url":"command"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/root","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=compute,video,utility","MALLOC_TRIM_THRESHOLD_=131072","ATTACHED_DEVICES_PERMS=/dev/dri /dev/dvb /dev/vchiq /dev/vc-mem /dev/video1? -type c"],"exposed_ports":["8096/tcp","8920/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/jellyfin/builds/12.3ubu2604-ls2.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/jellyfin/builds/12.3ubu2604-ls2/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://li